! XRT-06 RT02(IOL 17.15・据付・変更しない)。主経路の先(間にスイッチ)・予備経路の片端・XR01 と iBGP。
! 主経路に BFD(100 ms × 3)と isis bfd を用意済み。BGP のグレースフル リスタートも有効。
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.255.0.12 255.255.255.255
 ip router isis CORE
!
interface Loopback1
 description SERVICES
 ip address 10.20.0.1 255.255.0.0
 ip router isis CORE
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description PRIMARY to XR01 via SW01
 ip address 10.0.2.12 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 bfd interval 100 min_rx 100 multiplier 3
 isis bfd
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[2] }}
 description BACKUP to RT01
 ip address 10.0.12.12 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 isis metric 1000
 no shutdown
!
router isis CORE
 net 49.0001.0100.0000.0012.00
 is-type level-2-only
 metric-style wide
 log-adjacency-changes
!
router bgp 65000
 bgp router-id 10.255.0.12
 bgp log-neighbor-changes
 bgp graceful-restart
 neighbor 10.255.0.1 remote-as 65000
 neighbor 10.255.0.1 update-source Loopback0
 address-family ipv4
  network 10.20.0.0 mask 255.255.0.0
  neighbor 10.255.0.1 activate
 exit-address-family
!
